      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya qara ka jia sadeeso, eegi worri Israeli lafa Misiri keesaa bahe, worri lafa aloo ta Sinai qubate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Refidimu kae lafa aloo ta Sinaitiini baanaani achiti gaara jalati qubate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Musani gaara kore Waaqa argu d'aqe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti AABBO Waaqi isaani dubbate waan jed'eeni, Waan atini worra Yakobo ka gosa Israelitini jettu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani yayu waan anini worra Misiri tolche agartani; ammalle aka anini aka qore worra dura isani bute worra duraa isani fuud'e ufitiini isani d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
