            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.11+DEU.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 4.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diirama guyya sadeeso baldooni dumansaa gaara ira mullatte, angaasu argani, mandisule d'agayani, ammalle magalata lalabani d'aani. Nami olla suni keesa jiru ch'ufti nahe hollate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani nama ch'ufa worra keesaa yaame gara Waaqa geese. Duuba worri golba gaara Sinai ejaanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aari gaara suni duuche, wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi ibida keesa gaara suniti d'ufe, aari sunini aka aara boola faara iti gubani olbahe; jennaani gaari sunini aka jaba chochoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle akuma qonqooni magalata guddattuuni, Musani dubbate, Waaqi mandisuuni jalaa qabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi fiit'e gaara Sinai gubbaa d'ufe Musa yaame, Musani iti olkore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, Beeni, gabui, biyya gorsi, aka worri seera taake na laaliti ind'umne; yo worri seera kana ch'abse, nami hedduuni daara d'aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaaloleeni ta nati d'iaachu feetu ha ufi qulqulleesitu, yokhaani anini worrale imballeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
